    dict(airport='Melbourne T2 (Mon 8 Feb, ~9pm-10:45pm)', lounge='Qantas International Business Lounge', access='yes', notes='Airside, level 1. Covered by the Business ticket. Melbourne Airport lists a 10:15pm Monday close, but Qantas says lounges stay open until the last departure and Monday QF49 is a new service from Dec 2026: re-check the hours in January and be at the gate by 10:45pm regardless.'),
    dict(airport='Melbourne T2, First Lounge (level 3), Mon 8 Feb ~9pm-10:45pm', lounge='Qantas International First Lounge', access='yes', notes='Confirmed: your two passes are Qantas Money Titanium First Lounge invitations, which are valid at the Sydney, Melbourne and Los Angeles First Lounges when you are flying on a QF or JQ flight number. Use ONE here: escalator near gates 9-10 up to level 3, show the invitation in the Qantas app. Sit-down dining (the Neil Perry menu), spa if you book on arrival, showers. The second pass cannot be used on this trip (Narita has no Qantas First Lounge and you leave Sydney from the domestic terminal), so keep it for a later international departure. Third-party listings put closing at 10:15-11:15pm; be at the gate by 10:45pm. Invitations are cardholder-only and expire, so check the expiry date in the app now.'),
